@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/materials
# JWT + RBAC: access token de un usuario con la concesión (401 sin token, 403 sin permiso).
@token = <access_token>

### PUT: reemplazo completo (status no se envía: solo cambia con deactivate) -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PET",
  "description": "Envases PET transparentes, limpios y sin tapa"
}

### PATCH: cambio parcial -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Envases PET compactados"
}

### PATCH: cuerpo vacío -> 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
